  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">More Food Mod 由 <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/members/volwert123\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Volwert123</a> 创建。新增了許多食物，例如：</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">烤胡蘿蔔</span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">海帶湯</span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">米飯</span></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">為了製作這些食物，還新增了一些新的原料！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">建議搭配模組 <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jei\" rel=\"nofollow\">Just Enough Items (JEI)</a></strong> 查看所有配方。</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">支援語言&nbsp;</span></strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">英語、德語、法語、西班牙語、俄語</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">更多語言即將推出。</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><strong>計畫中的功能</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">更多語言</span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">更多食物</span></span></li>\n</ul>",
